announcements.detail:
With reference to the aforesaid disclosures submitted by the company on March 04, 2026, we wish to clarify that due to an inadvertent clerical/typographical error, the percentage of requisite consideration received from the proposed allottees was mentioned as 62.14% instead of the correct percentage of 64.41%.

Accordingly, the relevant portion shall now be read as under;

The company has received only 62.41% of the requisite consideration from ....

Board of Directors in its Meeting held on 3rd April, 2026 has, inter alia, considered, noted and approved the following - 
1. Proposal of availing of Loan facility from Standard Chartered Bank of Rs. 20,00,00,000 for the Company;
2. To Provide Corporate Guarantee of Rs. 5,00,00,000 to Standard Chartered Bank for Avyom Foodtech Private Limited subject to the approval of shareholders in General Meeting.
